<br>
1.Matam Hai Dojahan May Mushkil Kusha Ali Ka.<br>
Nouha Hai Har Zubaan Par Shere Quda Ali Ka.<br>
<br>
2.Mehrab Or Musalla Rangeen Hai Lahoo Se.<br>
Qatil Ne Haaye Zaqmi Sar Kardiya Ali Ka.<br>
<br>
3.Arshe Bareen Pe Nouha Jibreel Padhraha Hai.<br>
Hoor O Malak May Matam Barpa Hai Wa Ali Ka.<br>
<br>
4.Taari Hai Ghash Ka Aalam Har Ek Rooraha Hai.<br>
Shiyon Ke Sar Se Utha Lo Aasra Ali Ka.<br>
<br>
5.Laaya Tha Zeher May Wo Talwar Ko Bujhakar.<br>
Zaalim Ne Yunn Utara Ehsaan Kya Ali Ka.<br>
<br>
6.Zainab Ke Baein Sunkar Rooti Hain Bibiyaan Sab.<br>
Baitul Sharaf Bana Hai Matam Kada Ali Ka.<br>
<br>
7.Bewaa Yateem Rokar Koofe Ke Kehrahe Hain.<br>
Dukh Dard May Tha Humko Ek Aasra Ali Ka.<br>
<br>
8.Ashke Azaye Sarwar Aankhon May Aagaye Hain.<br>
Tune Layeeq Jisdam Nouha Likha Ali Ka.<br>
<br>
